{%- comment -%}
  Data cover of one research line: its slice of the paper map on the shared
  year axis (SVG built by _plugins/research-data.rb, styles in
  _sass/signal/_covers.scss). Decorative: the card or page text next to it
  carries the paper count and years.
  include params: line (an entry of site.data.research.lines), slug (project
  slug, for the view transition), class (extra classes)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign r = site.data.research -%}
<div class="line-cover {{ include.class }}" style="view-transition-name: line-{{ include.slug }}" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="cover-plot">
    {{- include.line.cover -}}
    <span class="line-cover-axis"
      ><span>{{ r.first_year }}</span><span>{{ r.last_year }}</span></span
    >
  </span>
</div>
